{"id":14818,"date":"2024-10-25T17:18:47","date_gmt":"2024-10-25T17:18:47","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/?p=14818"},"modified":"2024-12-11T18:01:05","modified_gmt":"2024-12-11T18:01:05","slug":"devlop-presente-como-oradora-no-dia-do-transitario-2024","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/devlop-presente-como-oradora-no-dia-do-transitario-2024\/","title":{"rendered":"Devlop Presente como Oradora no Dia do Transit\u00e1rio 2024"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"14818\" class=\"elementor elementor-14818\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b0f266b e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"b0f266b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3c5683d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3c5683d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.18.0 - 08-12-2023 *\/\n.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-stacked .elementor-drop-cap{background-color:#69727d;color:#fff}.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-framed .elementor-drop-cap{color:#69727d;border:3px solid;background-color:transparent}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap{margin-top:8px}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap-letter{width:1em;height:1em}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap{float:left;text-align:center;line-height:1;font-size:50px}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap-letter{display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\t<h4>Devlop Presente como Oradora no Evento Procurement Confer\u00eancia\u00a0<\/h4><p>No dia 25 de outubro de 2024, a Devlop marcou presen\u00e7a no emblem\u00e1tico evento &#8220;Dia do Transit\u00e1rio&#8221;, organizado pela APAT &#8211; Associa\u00e7\u00e3o dos Transit\u00e1rios de Portugal, que este ano celebra o seu 50\u00ba anivers\u00e1rio.<\/p><p>O evento, realizado no id\u00edlico complexo hoteleiro Dolce Campo Real, em Torres Vedras, reuniu mais de 150 participantes, incluindo cerca de 60 empresas transit\u00e1rias associadas da APAT, representantes de entidades governamentais e do setor portu\u00e1rio.<\/p><p>A edi\u00e7\u00e3o deste ano, sob o mote &#8220;O Impacto da Digitaliza\u00e7\u00e3o na Atividade Transit\u00e1ria&#8221;, proporcionou uma plataforma \u00fanica para debater os desafios e oportunidades que a transforma\u00e7\u00e3o digital apresenta para o setor.<\/p><p>A Devlop teve o privil\u00e9gio de participar ativamente nesta discuss\u00e3o, com o seu CEO, Hugo Duarte da Fonseca, integrando a mesa-redonda da sess\u00e3o matinal dedicada a este tema crucial.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-357bd40 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"357bd40\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.18.0 - 08-12-2023 *\/\n.elementor-column .elementor-spacer-inner{height:var(--spacer-size)}.e-con{--container-widget-width:100%}.e-con-inner>.elementor-widget-spacer,.e-con>.elementor-widget-spacer{width:var(--container-widget-width,var(--spacer-size));--align-self:var(--container-widget-align-self,initial);--flex-shrink:0}.e-con-inner>.elementor-widget-spacer>.elementor-widget-container,.e-con>.elementor-widget-spacer>.elementor-widget-container{height:100%;width:100%}.e-con-inner>.elementor-widget-spacer>.elementor-widget-container>.elementor-spacer,.e-con>.elementor-widget-spacer>.elementor-widget-container>.elementor-spacer{height:100%}.e-con-inner>.elementor-widget-spacer>.elementor-widget-container>.elementor-spacer>.elementor-spacer-inner,.e-con>.elementor-widget-spacer>.elementor-widget-container>.elementor-spacer>.elementor-spacer-inner{height:var(--container-widget-height,var(--spacer-size))}.e-con-inner>.elementor-widget-spacer.elementor-widget-empty,.e-con>.elementor-widget-spacer.elementor-widget-empty{position:relative;min-height:22px;min-width:22px}.e-con-inner>.elementor-widget-spacer.elementor-widget-empty .elementor-widget-empty-icon,.e-con>.elementor-widget-spacer.elementor-widget-empty .elementor-widget-empty-icon{position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;margin:auto;padding:0;width:22px;height:22px}<\/style>\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-99fb022 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"99fb022\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b39dda4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b39dda4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Durante a sua interven\u00e7\u00e3o, Hugo Duarte da Fonseca juntou-se a outros especialistas do setor para destacar a import\u00e2ncia da digitaliza\u00e7\u00e3o na atividade transit\u00e1ria.<\/p><p>Enfatizou como as novas tecnologias est\u00e3o a remodelar os processos operacionais, oferecendo oportunidades sem precedentes para aumentar a efici\u00eancia, reduzir custos e melhorar a transpar\u00eancia em toda a cadeia log\u00edstica.<\/p><p>Sublinhou ainda v\u00e1rias vantagens que a digitaliza\u00e7\u00e3o traz ao setor, incluindo:<\/p><ol class=\"marker:text-textOff list-decimal pl-8\"><li><p>Otimiza\u00e7\u00e3o de processos atrav\u00e9s da automa\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/p><\/li><li><p>Melhoria na visibilidade e rastreabilidade das cargas.<\/p><\/li><li><p>Facilita\u00e7\u00e3o da colabora\u00e7\u00e3o entre diferentes atores da cadeia log\u00edstica.<\/p><\/li><li><p>Redu\u00e7\u00e3o de erros e aumento da precis\u00e3o nas opera\u00e7\u00f5es.<\/p><\/li><li><p>Capacidade de an\u00e1lise de dados em tempo real para tomada de decis\u00f5es mais informadas.<\/p><\/li><\/ol><p>Al\u00e9m disso, Hugo Duarte da Fonseca abordou os desafios que a digitaliza\u00e7\u00e3o ajuda a superar, como a complexidade crescente das cadeias de abastecimento globais, a necessidade de resposta r\u00e1pida \u00e0s mudan\u00e7as do mercado e as exig\u00eancias cada vez maiores dos clientes por servi\u00e7os mais \u00e1geis e transparentes.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1e7a6a2 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"1e7a6a2\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0c106fb elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"0c106fb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f901d0e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f901d0e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>A participa\u00e7\u00e3o da Devlop neste evento n\u00e3o s\u00f3 demonstrou o seu compromisso com o avan\u00e7o tecnol\u00f3gico no setor, mas tamb\u00e9m refor\u00e7ou a sua posi\u00e7\u00e3o como l\u00edder em solu\u00e7\u00f5es digitais para a cadeia de abastecimento.<\/p><p>Este posicionamento est\u00e1 alinhado com a recente expans\u00e3o da empresa, que inclui a aquisi\u00e7\u00e3o de uma empresa complementar na regi\u00e3o de Leiria, praticamente duplicando o seu tamanho e ampliando sua oferta de solu\u00e7\u00f5es para log\u00edstica.\u00a0<\/p><p>O Dia do Transit\u00e1rio 2024 foi mais do que um evento setorial; foi uma celebra\u00e7\u00e3o do progresso e da resili\u00eancia do setor transit\u00e1rio em Portugal.<\/p><p>A Devlop tem o prazer de felicitar a APAT pelos seus 50 anos de dedica\u00e7\u00e3o ao desenvolvimento e fortalecimento da atividade transit\u00e1ria no pa\u00eds.<\/p><p>A presen\u00e7a da empresa neste evento reafirma o seu compromisso em contribuir para um futuro mais digitalizado e eficiente para o setor log\u00edstico portugu\u00eas.<\/p><p>\u00c0 medida que o setor continua a evoluir, a Devlop mant\u00e9m-se na vanguarda da inova\u00e7\u00e3o, pronta para enfrentar os desafios futuros e aproveitar as oportunidades que a era digital oferece ao mundo da log\u00edstica e dos transportes.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-00af709 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"00af709\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-85e5b74 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"85e5b74\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3c90581 elementor-skin-carousel elementor-arrows-yes elementor-pagination-type-bullets elementor-pagination-position-outside elementor-widget elementor-widget-media-carousel\" data-id=\"3c90581\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;space_between&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:8,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;skin&quot;:&quot;carousel&quot;,&quot;effect&quot;:&quot;slide&quot;,&quot;show_arrows&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;pagination&quot;:&quot;bullets&quot;,&quot;speed&quot;:500,&quot;autoplay&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;autoplay_speed&quot;:5000,&quot;loop&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;pause_on_hover&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;pause_on_interaction&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;space_between_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:10,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;space_between_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:10,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"media-carousel.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/wp-content\/plu